EmitInstanceCallAOT is positively excluded: it clears R4 to zero
(`LoadImmediate(R4, 0)`) and uses LoadDoubleWordFromPoolIndex, neither of which
appears at A.

So `0xf` here is Function::unchecked_entry_point_ on the TARGET Function, and the
earlier SingleTargetCache reading is withdrawn. The offset was genuinely
ambiguous; the emission source is not.

